nks, information blocks, decode relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with scientific devices and lab elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story delivered via environment and audio cues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002040/extras/f3c55e271f7a543e3d74264c7b654d04.avif?t=1774382963\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002040/extras_big/f3c55e271f7a543e3d74264c7b654d04.avif?t=1774382963 width=800 height=342 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong><br>• VR puzzles and exploration: complete immersion in virtual reality.<br>• Sci-fi atmosphere and high-tech laboratory setting.<br>• Emphasis on thought over action: logic, combinations, intuition.<br>• Single-player narrative experience with deep ambiance.<br>• Audio design and music heighten suspense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >vr puzzle, vr mystery, vr science game, virtual reality lab, higgs boson experiment, vr investigation, vr exploration, vr logic puzzles, vr atmospheric, vr sci-fi</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dofamine VR is an immersive first-person VR puzzle game set in a sci-fi environment, where you navigate a dark laboratory to uncover the cause of a catastrophic event. Blending exploration, logical puzzles, interactive environments, and tense atmosphere, this game offers a memorable journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002040/extras/c9bf5d4555d2162e1877f8c2b996668d.avif?t=1774382963\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_